240.m:
Rāma said:
Counsel-power is praised above power of majesty and energetic power;
endowed with majesty and energy, Śukra was defeated by the priest of the gods.

241.m:
Agni said: / Rama, having slain Rāvaṇa, reached Ayodhyā, O twice-born; / formerly Lakṣmaṇa slew Indrajit by the statecraft spoken by Rāma.
Thus ends the two hundred and forty-first chapter, entitled 'The Statecraft Spoken by Rāma', in the great Agni Purāṇa.
